    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/545757ad6fcc877d493c30fa97a1cd71.poster.avif?t=1733495443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/545757ad6fcc877d493c30fa97a1cd71.webm?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/545757ad6fcc877d493c30fa97a1cd71.mp4?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE MAGICAL WORLD OF DOODLE TAXI</h2><br>Do you miss good old days? No loot boxes, no micro transactions, no season passes? Maybe early 2000s open world games? I got your back!<br><br><strong>Get ready for a Zen-like experience</strong><br>Doodle Taxi's main thing is being a chill taxi driving simulator game. Enjoy this beautiful world as you cruise around and color it in while unraveling the story! Whether you want to drive around like a maniac or just chill out and listen to the bumping soundtrack, this is a great pick up and play driving game!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/e5b167f08abea99ba6a6f046282b6efa.poster.avif?t=1733495443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/e5b167f08abea99ba6a6f046282b6efa.webm?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/e5b167f08abea99ba6a6f046282b6efa.mp4?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GOOFY STORY</h2><br>What's the worst thing that could happen to a modern day Taxi Driver? Not getting paid? Get mugged? No. A cabbie can get cursed by a witch and lose his sight. What if that witch is unable to control her powers in this world? What happens then?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/672dbe6cbbfda59cda5d329722ec7076.poster.avif?t=1733495443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/672dbe6cbbfda59cda5d329722ec7076.webm?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/672dbe6cbbfda59cda5d329722ec7076.mp4?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT THE CAR!?</h2><br>This is a car game obviously. And we should have cars, more than one. Unlockable, locked behind some in-game currency. But don't worry, you can earn all these without spending real money. This is a game by a gamer who misses old days for the gamers who are sick of those modern tricks to squeeze more and more money from player. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/18fa1a7efdc1984dc2e6c16bf3e26791.poster.avif?t=1733495443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/18fa1a7efdc1984dc2e6c16bf3e26791.webm?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504470/extras/18fa1a7efdc1984dc2e6c16bf3e26791.mp4?t=1733495443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY WISE, WHAT'S GOING ON?</h2><br>You can play forever, there is a high replayability. Story part? Eh, this one is pretty straight forward. You can easily understand and enjoy core gameplay even more. It's not a Shakespeare, but this witch is quite the poet!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BANGER SOUNDTRACK</h2>When I say banger soundtrack, be sure that I'm telling truth. I'm so glad that so many talented indie musicians donated their awesome songs into this one, including;<br>Abstraction / Cat Temper / Obsidian Contraption / Colourful Energy / Dragon-Orb / Vercin Featherix / No Lake / Nelson &amp; Bernstein / SparraLIMB<br><br><strong>Wrapping up</strong><br>So drive your car fast and careful, keep that 'being a good driver' meter at green, deliver customers on time. That's the name of the game. Thanks for reading so far and I wish you to enjoy my game.",
