ER SOUNDTRACK</h2>When I say banger soundtrack, be sure that I'm telling truth. I'm so glad that so many talented indie musicians donated their awesome songs into this one, including;<br>Abstraction / Cat Temper / Obsidian Contraption / Colourful Energy / Dragon-Orb / Vercin Featherix / No Lake / Nelson &amp; Bernstein / SparraLIMB<br><br><strong>Wrapping up</strong><br>So drive your car fast and careful, keep that 'being a good driver' meter at green, deliver customers on time. That's the name of the game. Thanks for reading so far and I wish you to enjoy my game.",
